# The project's URL and its PUBLIC anon key. Both are safe in this bundle: the
# anon key can read and write nothing on its own - every table is closed to it
# by RLS, and access is granted only to a signed-in user who is also a row in
# `admin_users`. The service_role key must NEVER appear in this file.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
